        {
          "id": "when-oil-consumption-is-serious",
          "title": "⚠️ When oil consumption is serious",
          "description": "These symptoms mean immediate action is required:",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                "Consumption > 1L per 500 miles",
                "Blue smoke visible from exhaust",
                "Oil warning light appears",
                "Loss of power accompanies consumption"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Consequences of ignoring:"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                "Bearing damage - Low oil causes bearing failure (£800-£10,000+)",
                "Catalytic converter/DPF damage - Burning oil blocks the emissions system (£500-£2,000)",
                "Engine seizure - Complete engine failure (£1,500-£8,000+)"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The oil check reminder: Check your oil level every two weeks and before long journeys. This simple habit can save you £5,000+."
            },
